>> i := 0.
Wetonan tulis: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], baris-anyar.
{ Wetonan tulis: i, baris-anyar. } sasuwene: { i tambah: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Wetonan tulis: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], baris-anyar.
{ Wetonan tulis: i, baris-anyar. } sasuwene: { i suda: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
